        "TileImage": "$($repository f035debd-bd17-47c2-8f3b-1b9f1746d817).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47, Cassandra Snow is having a book signing tomorrow at her local church and the proceeds are going to the church. Miss Snow has hired us to take care of a few problems she has been having with her recent book sale. \r\rLorenzo was tasked with making a short film of her books but has been taking from the production account.\r\rEttore, Raymond, and Douglas have been stealing money from the fundraiser and are planning to run.\r\rReginaldo...well he just has bad taste in clothes, he must go.",
